{"type":"message","id":"2660d4bf","parentId":"cd9e8357","timestamp":"2026-03-31T09:21:02.631Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_k7q9zbqlmk6n_1","toolName":"feishu_calendar_event","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"awaiting_app_authorization\": true,\n  \"message\": \"已向用户发送授权引导卡片，等待用户完成授权操作。请告知用户：按照卡片提示完成授权，完成后系统将自动重试之前的操作。请等待用户完成卡片操作，不要建议其他替代方案。\",\n  \"missing_scopes\": [\n    \"calendar:calendar.event:read\"\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"awaiting_app_authorization":true,"message":"已向用户发送授权引导卡片，等待用户完成授权操作。请告知用户：按照卡片提示完成授权，完成后系统将自动重试之前的操作。请等待用户完成卡片操作，不要建议其他替代方案。","missing_scopes":["calendar:calendar.event:read"]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774948862626}}
{"type":"message","id":"c13c80ab","parentId":"2660d4bf","timestamp":"2026-03-31T09:21:08.787Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hmm, calendar:calendar:read works but calendar:calendar.event:read is missing. This is a different scope. It seems the user authorized basic calendar access but not event read. Let me inform about this.","thinkingSignature":"9378ba2274fd07b21681dac6f248b4d8cdbd3416d5d71a209191f8d1d1c0f9c9"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n下午好～今天下午 5 点多有件事需要说一下：\n\n日历的主日历读取权限（`calendar:calendar.event:read`）还没授权，目前只能读取\"忙闲信息\"，无法查看具体日程详情。\n\n如果你希望我能帮你看日程的话，麻烦重新授权一下～ 如果只是偶尔查一下，其实也没那么紧急，不影响日常使用。\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2592,"output":124,"cacheRead":36643,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39359,"cost":{"input":0.0007775999999999999,"output":0.00014879999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00219858,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00312498}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774948862632,"responseId":"061ac4fe22605b26f63158ff6262b318"}}
