{"type":"message","id":"0460617a","parentId":"97205927","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:50:53.361Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_c37iaq16o67h_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-31 日终记录\n\n## 今日事项\n\n### 日历授权问题\n- **问题**：日历权限不足，`calendar:calendar:read` 和 `calendar:calendar.event:read` 两个 scope 均缺失\n- **上午**：尝试查询日程，返回\"需要重新授权\"提示；发送了授权卡片\n- **下午**：日历元数据（primary calendar）读取恢复，但查看具体日程事件仍报 `calendar:calendar.event:read` 权限缺失\n- **状态**：\n  - ✅ `calendar:calendar:read` → 已恢复（可读 primary calendar 元数据）\n  - ❌ `calendar:calendar.event:read` → 仍缺失（无法查看日程详情，只能看忙闲）\n- **处理**：已告知频哥，让他决定是否重新授权\n\n### 其他\n- 今日 heartbeat 检查均正常执行\n- 无错题本上传记录\n- git 无变化，无需 push\n\n## 待跟进\n- [ ] 频哥对日历授权的回复（如果不想授权，目前功能降级可接受）\n\n## 频哥/女儿动态\n- 周深歌单确认状态：✅ 已确认（TODO 已完成）\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774965053357}}
{"type":"message","id":"b30938e7","parentId":"0460617a","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:50:58.363Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I have today's memory. Now let me:\n1. Summarize today\n2. Update MEMORY.md if needed\n3. Update .learnings/ if needed\n4. Push to git if there are changes\n\nLet me also check if there's anything in .learnings/ that needs updating.\n\nToday's summary:\n- 日历权限问题处理完毕，已告知频哥\n- 周深歌单确认已完成（之前记录的待确认状态已解决）\n- 没有其他特殊事项\n\nLet me check MEMORY.md to see if anything needs updating - particularly around the calendar auth issue and the 周深歌单 confirmation.","thinkingSignature":"a653dfa709e7a03a1f412d57b0e528a28773a0945407d04c224c34d74147944a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_u1dnj4ze3o7k_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace && git status"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2906,"output":164,"cacheRead":36643,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39713,"cost":{"input":0.0008717999999999999,"output":0.00019679999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00219858,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0032671799999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774965053361,"responseId":"061b043d5ab974e8eeb7f5814d6c8df4"}}
